{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf07_1", "label": "Render Logs Screenshot: dt4fm-system calling openMAINT (Sep 3, pilot test INF07)", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "docs/pruebas-piloto/img-inf07-1.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Evidence screenshot for pilot test INF07: shows the production backend on Render successfully authenticating against openMAINT (POST /sessions -> 200) and resolving Employee cards by LoginUser and PortalUsername (GET -> 200). Proves the Render -> openMAINT network path and credentials work in production."}, {"id": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf07_1_render_dashboard", "label": "Render Dashboard (Logs view, Application logs, Last hour)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/pruebas-piloto/img-inf07-1.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf07_1_dt4fm_system_render_service", "label": "dt4fm-system web service (Render, DT4FM project, Production environment)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/pruebas-piloto/img-inf07-1.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The NestJS backend is hosted on Render as service dt4fm-system inside the Production environment; instance id 4cfb5 emits the HTTP client logs shown."}, {"id": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf07_1_openmaint_rest_api_v3", "label": "openMAINT / CMDBuild REST API v3 (http://187.77.250.224:8090/cmdbuild/services/rest/v3)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/pruebas-piloto/img-inf07-1.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf07_1_cmdbuild_sessions_endpoint", "label": "POST /sessions?scope=service&returnId=true (openMAINT service-scope login)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/pruebas-piloto/img-inf07-1.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Login is requested with scope=service and returnId=true so openMAINT returns a reusable sessionId (not a browser cookie) that the backend then attaches to subsequent REST calls. The 200 response confirms credentials are valid in production."}, {"id": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf07_1_employee_lookup_loginuser", "label": "GET /classes/Employee/cards filter LoginUser equal 628914", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/pruebas-piloto/img-inf07-1.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Resolves the Employee card linked to a CMDBuild user id (LoginUser reference attribute). The filter is a JSON object {attribute:{simple:{attribute,operator,value}}} URL-encoded into the query string."}, {"id": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf07_1_employee_lookup_portalusername", "label": "GET /classes/Employee/cards filter PortalUsername equal [wilmer.palma] limit=1", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/pruebas-piloto/img-inf07-1.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Alternative Employee resolution keyed by the portal username string (used by the cleaning-tasks flow) rather than by CMDBuild user id; value is passed as an array and limit=1 because only one card is expected."}, {"id": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf07_1_cmdbuild_json_filter_encoding", "label": "CMDBuild JSON attribute filter (URL-encoded simple filter)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/pruebas-piloto/img-inf07-1.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "CMDBuild REST v3 filters cards via a JSON document in the filter query param; the backend builds it as an object, JSON.stringify + encodeURIComponent, which is why the logged URLs show %7B%22attribute%22... sequences."}, {"id": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf07_1_http_client_request_logging", "label": "[HTTP] outbound request logging (method, URL, -> status)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/pruebas-piloto/img-inf07-1.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The backend logs every outbound HTTP call twice: once when issued ([HTTP] METHOD url) and once on completion (same line with '-> status'). This makes external integration behaviour observable from Render logs without extra tooling, which is what the pilot test relies on as evidence."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf07_1", "target": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf07_1_render_dashboard", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/pruebas-piloto/img-inf07-1.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf07_1", "target": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf07_1_dt4fm_system_render_service", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/pruebas-piloto/img-inf07-1.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf07_1", "target": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf07_1_openmaint_rest_api_v3", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/pruebas-piloto/img-inf07-1.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf07_1", "target": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf07_1_cmdbuild_sessions_endpoint", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/pruebas-piloto/img-inf07-1.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf07_1", "target": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf07_1_employee_lookup_loginuser", "relation": "referenc